# NOTE ON STRUCTURE — Cloudflare Pages APPENDS the headers of every matching
# rule; a more specific rule does not replace a broader one. Two
# Content-Security-Policy headers are intersected by the browser, so an earlier
# `/*` rule carrying `frame-ancestors 'self'` silently overrode the embed's
# `frame-ancestors *` and made /embed.html un-framable. X-Frame-Options behaves
# the same way. So: only non-conflicting headers go under /*, and CSP (which
# carries frame-ancestors) is declared exactly once per path. X-Frame-Options is
# omitted entirely — `frame-ancestors` supersedes it in every current browser and
# a duplicate would reintroduce the bug.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), interest-cohort=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  X-Robots-Tag: noai

/
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://tiles.openfreemap.org; connect-src 'self' https://api.ukraine.bugg.club https://tiles.openfreemap.org; font-src 'self' https://tiles.openfreemap.org; worker-src 'self' blob:; frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'none'; object-src 'none'

/index.html
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://tiles.openfreemap.org; connect-src 'self' https://api.ukraine.bugg.club https://tiles.openfreemap.org; font-src 'self' https://tiles.openfreemap.org; worker-src 'self' blob:; frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'none'; object-src 'none'

/pages/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://tiles.openfreemap.org; connect-src 'self' https://api.ukraine.bugg.club https://tiles.openfreemap.org; font-src 'self' https://tiles.openfreemap.org; worker-src 'self' blob:; frame-ancestors 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'none'; object-src 'none'

# The one path meant to be iframed by other sites.
/embed.html
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://tiles.openfreemap.org; connect-src 'self' https://api.ukraine.bugg.club https://tiles.openfreemap.org; font-src 'self' https://tiles.openfreemap.org; worker-src 'self' blob:; frame-ancestors *; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'none'; object-src 'none'
